<!--
  UnrealScript project for Visual Studio 2022.

  Replaces MMOGame.ucproj, which needs the Visual Studio 2010 "UnrealScript" extension (PixelMine) that does
  not exist for newer Visual Studio. This is a Makefile project: it lists the .uc sources so they show up in
  Solution Explorer, and Build runs the UE3 script compiler exactly as MScript.bat and the build server do:
      MMOGame.exe make -auto -unattended -AllowScriptWarnings -NOPAUSEONSUCCESS -full -DEMOMODE
